"center">0.539</td><td align="center">0.611</td></tr><tr><td align="left">4</td><td align="center"><bold>                              <italic>                                 <underline>0.810</underline>                              </italic>                           </bold></td><td align="center">0.664</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 2</td><td align="center">0.637</td><td align="center">0.706</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 3</td><td align="center">0.770</td><td align="center">0.670</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 4</td><td align="center">0.802</td><td align="center">0.663</td></tr><tr><td align="left">2, 3</td><td align="center">0.532</td><td align="center">0.638</td></tr><tr><td align="left">2, 4</td><td align="center">0.704</td><td align="center"><bold>                              <italic>                                 <underline>0.750</underline>                              </italic>                           </bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left">3, 4</td><td align="center">0.782</td><td align="center">0.678</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 2, 3</td><td align="center">0.688</td><td align="center">0.694</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 2, 4</td><td align="center">0.782</td><td align="center">0.720</td></tr><tr><td align="left">1, 3, 4</td><td align="center">0.800</td><td align="center">0.678</td></tr><tr><td align="left">2, 3, 4</td><td align="center">0.689</td><td align="center">0.703</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Geometrical averages of the connectivity estimation obtained for the two communities while considering the 14 combinations of measurements listed in the first column. The best combinations for communities 1 and 2 were respectively the matching index (4) and the pair of measurements involving the clustering coefficient (2) and matching index (4). The configurations leading to the best matches have been emphasized.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T5"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>Network rec